title: Remove pallet::getter usage from pallet-state-trie-migration
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Replaces the `#[pallet::getter]` attributes of `pallet-state-trie-migration` with explicit public
    functions on `Pallet<T>`. `migration_process()`, `auto_limits()` and
    `signed_migration_max_limits()` keep their signatures, so no changes are needed downstream.
crates:
- name: pallet-state-trie-migration
  bump: patch
